        "text": "top of page\n# Yap-Jequinto for\nUnion City Council 2026\n# Ann Ruth\nYap-Jequinto\nfor\nUnion City Council District 4\n### LIFE OF SERVICE\nI have seen Union City grow over the years. I am running, because I want to make sure that progress benefits every resident and preserves the strong, caring community we pass on to future generations.​\n​\nAs a Rotarian, I am guided by the principle of service above self, prioritizing the community over personal gain while leading through service and collaboration.\nFOLLOW ANN RUTH ON SOCIAL MEDIA\nSubscribe\nbottom of page",
